so that was difficult.

00:08:57.230 --> 00:08:58.080
- Or awesome.

00:08:58.080 --> 00:08:59.400
- [Angela] Or awesome, yeah.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.900
- So The Office is coming
to the NBC streaming

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.040
service right now so
would you do a reboot?

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.280
Would y'all do it?

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:06.670
- We talk about this all the time,

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:09.330
we wanna do a reunion special.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:11.910
Like a reason that everyone in The Office

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:13.940
has to reunite for some reason

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.570
like a one time special episode.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.470
- Like a movie, like a reunion movie.

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:19.870
- Yeah, because I think
a reboot would be hard.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:22.870
I think at the end of
the series I mean spoiler

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.360
alert for anyone who's still in the middle

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.420
of it but some of the people don't end up

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.690
staying at the paper company anymore.

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:31.540
They move on, they move
away and so to manufacture

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:33.230
some reason why we're
all working there again

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:36.040
I think would be odd but
I think there is a reason

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.900
that we could all reunite
in some other way.

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:38.890
So that's what we're

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:39.723
- We have some ideas.

00:09:39.723 --> 00:09:40.630
- That's what we want, call us!

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:42.840
- Call us NBC, email us.

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:43.673
- I think it would be so good,

00:09:43.673 --> 00:09:45.940
like I said it's just got such a new life.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.760
Like people are, like of a younger age

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:48.910
are getting into these characters.

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:49.910
It's really cool.

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:51.820
- And on a selfish level,
I would like to work

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.140
with all those people again, I'd like

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.480
to have us all in a room together.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:56.970
- It's such a great
chemistry, great vibe, yeah.

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:59.450
- I teared up when I got here
because your security guy,

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.960
Joseph, outside did security

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.070
for The Office for seven years.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:04.310
We saw him everyday.

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:05.480
- We gave Joseph a big hug.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.313
- We gave him a big hug.

00:10:06.313 --> 00:10:09.030
He use to help me when
my daughter came to set,

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:10.450
I had like a little, you know,

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:12.340
the little pink car you push your kid

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:13.890
around in and it's really loud.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.223
- And everyone loves you.

00:10:16.223 --> 00:10:17.056
- Everyone loves you.

00:10:17.056 --> 00:10:18.780
I would like push her around and Joseph

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:20.610
would like help me take
it out and set it out

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:21.970
and he's just a sweetheart.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:24.690
But I would love to see everyone again.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:27.311
- We might have to steal Joseph
for that week of shooting.

00:10:27.311 --> 00:10:28.804
- [Kelly] That's okay.

